  "historyNote": "#6154, eff 12-29-95, EXPIRED: 12-29-03 New. #10059, eff 12-23-11; ss by #12952, INTERIM, eff 12-21-19, EXPIRED: 6-18-20 New. #13195, eff 4-24-21",
